title: The Committee Votes
subtitle: Fifty-one hands decide who leads the party.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: congress_cc21 = 2 and e21_cc_closed = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 9
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_cc_closed = 1;
RG.congressEnd();
var tot = Q.congress_delegates_total || 51;
var forv = Math.round(Q.congress_votes_for * tot / 100);
Q.e21_cc_for = forv;
Q.e21_cc_against = Math.max(0, tot - forv);
Q.e21_cc_won = Q.congress_won ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e21_cc_mode == 1 && Q.e21_cc_won) {
    // Levi beats Rákosi
    Q.independence += 10;
    Q.junior_faction = 'unionist';
    RG.defy();
    RG.ecci('zinoviev', -8);
    RG.news('Central Committee rejects Rákosi: Levi keeps the chair', 3);
    RG.ledger('Paul Levi defeated Rákosi\'s resolution in the Central Committee and kept the chair.', 'e21_cc_levi_won');
} else if (Q.e21_cc_mode == 2 && Q.e21_cc_won) {
    // Brandler's compromise: Levi stays, with the Right beside him
    Q.junior_faction = 'unionist';
    Q.unity += 3;
    RG.comply(40);
    RG.ecci('radek', 5);
    RG.news('Brandler\'s compromise carried: Levi stays, Livorno approved in principle', 3);
} else {
    // Rákosi's resolution passes: Levi and his friends resign
    Q.e21_levi_resigned = 1;
    Q.e21_levi_leads = 0;
    Q.e21_lux_leads = 0;
    Q.leading_faction = 'offensive';
    Q.junior_faction = 'unionist';
    Q.unity -= 5;
    RG.setRole('levi', 'Reichstag deputy');
    RG.setRole('brandler', 'Chairman of the Zentrale');
    RG.comply(100);
    RG.news('Rákosi wins the vote: Levi, Zetkin and Däumig leave the Zentrale', 3);
    RG.ledger('Paul Levi lost the vote in the Central Committee and resigned the chair.', 'e21_levi_resigned');
}
!}

= The Committee Votes

The vote is taken late on the third day by a show of hands. Rákosi sits at the end of the table and counts for himself.

[? if e21_cc_mode = 1 and e21_cc_won = 1 : Rákosi's resolution falls, [+ e21_cc_for +] votes to [+ e21_cc_against +], and Levi keeps the chair. Rákosi leaves Berlin the next morning. His report to Moscow calls the German Zentrale a nest of Serratis. ?][? if e21_cc_mode = 2 and e21_cc_won = 1 : Brandler's resolution carries, [+ e21_cc_for +] votes to [+ e21_cc_against +]. Livorno is approved in principle, and Serrati is regretted in a subordinate clause. Levi keeps the chair, with Brandler and Thalheimer at his elbow. Rákosi calls it a rotten compromise. ?][? if e21_cc_won = 0 : Rákosi's resolution passes, [+ e21_cc_against +] votes to [+ e21_cc_for +]. Levi, Zetkin, Däumig, Hoffmann and Brass resign from the Zentrale the same evening. Brandler and Walter Stoecker take the chair. ?]

[? if congress_close_call = 1 : Two or three hands decided it, and everybody in the room knows whose they were. ?]
